# The Amazin' Scorpio (windurst 61): 481's finish with a non-zero option. Soni-Muni's finish begins the quest on any
# option (the Lua's addQuest ignores it), so option 1 begins it as option 0 does (the main flow); her next talk is 482.
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-17.0,1.75,-58.0 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 50
login
trigger Soni-Muni                       # level 2: 481 (0, 0, 1017)
finish option=1                         # begun (any option)
trigger Soni-Muni                       # accepted: 482 (0, 0, 1017)
finish
